# DDRMAX - Dance Dance Revolution 6th Mix (G*B19 VER. JAA), Konami 2001: first power-on from blank NVRAM, no inputs. The 573 BIOS boots the
# CD (the flash is blank): the CD first shows CD UPDATE and NOTE 604 (a version-up for the CD-ROM drive's firmware, which waits for Test). Hashes the main RAM every frame and
# snapshots every 60 frames, to compare with MAME.
game ddrmax

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

from 0 every 60 snap
at 3000 quit
